# facts you can claim on X

Copy to `config/x_drafts_facts.md` (gitignored) and fill it in. The x-drafts
job treats that file as the ONLY source of claims: the drafting model is told
never to invent a number, client or experience that is not here, and any number
in a draft that appears neither here nor in the day's source material gets the
draft dropped. Keep every line true and public-safe.

